Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The images are based on Debian and contain Debian packages, each under its own
license; see /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright in the images. Among them:

- rtslib-fb (Python library for the kernel target), Apache-2.0 license.
- targetcli-fb, Apache-2.0 license.
- PyYAML, MIT license.
- kmod, GPL-2.0-or-later (tools) and LGPL-2.1-or-later (library).

The kernel target (LIO) itself is part of the host's Linux kernel and is not
contained in the images.
